<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Locates - DESMIADT Route 3 (updated 11/10/26)</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Line colors = locate ticket status</b>: red = conflict / problem (incl. lack of response by excavator, insufficient information), yellow = standby, orange = pending, green = all clear / marked, <b>light blue = running line not called in yet</b>.<br/><b>Line type (from the plan legend)</b>: solid = U.G. fiber in conduit / conduit path; dashed (drawn as dashes, thinner) = U.G. IST.<br/><b>Boxes</b>: square = new HH (handhole) or FP (flower pot, 10x10 Round), colored by ticket status (light blue if not inside a ticket). <b>Yellow circle = EXISTING HH/MH</b> (plan legend: EX. MH/HH DETAIL).<br/><b>Run labels</b> read: number of conduits x size SDR11 ORANGE - length, e.g. 2x 1.25" SDR11 ORANGE - 130'. Count and length come from the plan callouts (BORE (1.25)PD - length, N CONDUITS); where the plan prints no count the run is 1 conduit (owner). Material per the BOM: 1.25" = INRDCT 1.25 SDR 11 ORANGE UG; 2.5" = INRDCT 2.5 SDR11 ORANGE W/LW; 1.25" ARMORED DUCT = ARMOR SDR11 ORANGE (marked at the PLACE 1.25" ARMORED DUCT callouts).<br/>Placement accuracy about +/-10-15 ft (sheets georeferenced from street labels and fitted to the ticket dig areas). Status as of 11/10/26 10:10 AM CST.<br/><b>Handhole / box sizes (plan callout -> spec name from the size reference):</b><br/>10x10  =  HH 10x10 ROUND SL ST<br/>12x12  =  HH 12x12<br/>17x30x24  =  HH 17x30x24<br/>30x48x36  =  HH 30x48x36 SPLIT LID NB<br/>13x24x18  =  HH 13x24x18 PL T22<br/>24x36x24  =  HH 24x36x24 SPLIT LID NB<br/>FP = 10x10 Round. Existing HH/MH (HH 3421, HH 3201, MH 352): size not printed - PENDING CONFIRMATION<br/>Reference list: HH 10x10in OR 12x12in; HH 10x10 ROUND SL ST; HH 12x12; HH 17x30x24in; HH 17x30x24; HH 30x48x36in; HH 30x48x36 SPLIT LID NB; HH 13x24x18in; HH 13x24x18 PL T22; HH 24x36x24in; HH 24x36x24 SPLIT LID NB]]></description>
